      skos:note "The H1 heading 'Some Other Title That Should Not Win' is a test assertion that the pipeline must not use this title as the derived slug or id. Paired with the absent id field, this tests slug-derivation logic." .

    # ── Style Observations ──────────────────────────────────────

    # 1. Minimal body register — single-word body signals intentional sparseness
    narr:StyleObs_MinimalBodyRegister
      a narr:StyleObservation ;
